{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somnium\u201d is a TPS action RPG in which players use their swords to defeat enemies and the bosses in each stage. While strengthening your own character in the boss-rush type dungeon, aim to clear the stage by using evasion, guarding, just guarding, jumping, and using drop items dropped by the boss. This work is for offline play. Get the skills you like, create your own character, defeat the bosses, become the champion of the dungeon, and escape from this eerie building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717060/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-05-14_173304.png?t=1761074230\" /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717060?t=1761074230","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717060?t=1761074230","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717060/ebba34e5731e607639d9422125bea5b041390c91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761074230","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717060/ebba34e5731e607639d9422125bea5b041390c91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761074230","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somnium\u201d is a TPS action RPG in which players use their swords to defeat enemies and the bosses in each stage. While strengthening your own character in the boss-rush type dungeon, aim to clear the stage by using evasion, guarding, just guarding, jumping, and using drop items dropped by the boss. This work is for offline play. Get the skills you like, create your own character, defeat the bosses, become the champion of the dungeon, and escape from this eerie building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph